### SYSC 4806 Lab 4 - HTTP requests for the AddressBook app
### Run the app first (AddressBookApplication), then run these top to bottom in
### IntelliJ (open this file and click the green arrows, or "Run All").
### The ids below assume a freshly started app (H2 is in-memory, so it starts empty).

### 1. Create address book #1
POST http://localhost:8080/addressbooks

### 2. Create address book #2
POST http://localhost:8080/addressbooks

### 3. Create a new buddy directly inside address book #1  (buddy id 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/addressbooks/1/buddies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rabby",
  "email": "Rabby@gmail.com",
  "phone": "123-456-7890",
  "address": "123 Main St, Carleton, ON",
  "nickname": "Rab"
}

### 4. Create another buddy inside address book #1  (buddy id 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/addressbooks/1/buddies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane",
  "email": "Jane@gmail.com",
  "phone": "987-654-3210",
  "address": "456 Elm St, Toronto, ON"
}

### 5. Create a stand-alone buddy that is not in any book yet  (buddy id 3)
POST http://localhost:8080/buddies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob",
  "email": "Bob@gmail.com",
  "phone": "555-555-5555",
  "address": "789 Oak St, Ottawa, ON"
}

### 6. Add the existing buddy #3 (Bob) to address book #2
PUT http://localhost:8080/addressbooks/2/buddies/3

### 7. Create another buddy inside address book #2  (buddy id 4)
POST http://localhost:8080/addressbooks/2/buddies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "email": "Alice@gmail.com",
  "phone": "613-555-0199",
  "address": "1125 Colonel By Dr, Ottawa, ON"
}

### 8. Read everything back as JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/addressbooks

### 9. Read one address book as JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/addressbooks/1

### 10. List all buddies as JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/buddies

### 11. Thymeleaf HTML view of address book #1 (also open in a browser)
GET http://localhost:8080/view/addressbooks/1

### 12. Thymeleaf HTML view of address book #2
GET http://localhost:8080/view/addressbooks/2
